sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant App as Consuming App<br/>(Spring Boot 1.4 / 2.6.5)
participant Ctrl as Web Controller<br/>(sample app)
participant Factory as MqClientFactory<br/>com.db.pwmus.mqclient.core
participant Cfg as mq-config.json<br/>(classpath)
participant Reg as ServiceLoader Registry<br/>java.util.ServiceLoader
participant Prov as IbmMqProvider<br/>com.db.pwmus.mqclient.ibmmq
participant SApi as MqSender (API)<br/>com.db.pwmus.mqclient.api
participant LApi as MqListener (API)<br/>com.db.pwmus.mqclient.api
participant SImpl as MqSender (IBM Impl)<br/>com.db.pwmus.mqclient.ibmmq
participant LImpl as MqListener (IBM Impl)<br/>com.db.pwmus.mqclient.ibmmq
participant MQ as IBM MQ Queue Manager

Note over App,Cfg: App owns mq-config.json and includes mq-client-util-core + mq-client-util-ibm-mq

App->>Factory: fromClasspath("mq-config.json")
Factory->>Cfg: read JSON config<br/>connections + queues
Factory->>Reg: ServiceLoader.load(MqProvider)
Reg-->>Factory: providersByType["IBM_MQ"] = IbmMqProvider

%% SEND FLOW
App->>Ctrl: GET /mq/sendJson?queue=requestQ&body=...
Ctrl->>Factory: sender("requestQ")
Factory->>Prov: createSender(connCfg, queueCfg)
Prov-->>Factory: new com.db.pwmus.mqclient.ibmmq.MqSender
Factory-->>Ctrl: SApi (backed by SImpl)
Ctrl->>SApi: sendJson(body)
SApi->>SImpl: sendJson(body)
SImpl->>MQ: PUT message to REQUEST.Q<br/>+ contentType=application/json<br/>+ correlationId (optional)<br/>+ replyTo (optional)
MQ-->>SImpl: ack/confirm
SImpl-->>Ctrl: OK

%% RECEIVE FLOW
App->>Ctrl: GET /mq/receive?queue=responseQ&timeoutSec=5
Ctrl->>Factory: listener("responseQ")
Factory->>Prov: createListener(connCfg, queueCfg)
Prov-->>Factory: new com.db.pwmus.mqclient.ibmmq.MqListener
Factory-->>Ctrl: LApi (backed by LImpl)
Ctrl->>LApi: receive(timeout)
LApi->>LImpl: receive(timeout)
LImpl->>MQ: GET message from RESPONSE.Q (blocking up to timeout)
MQ-->>LImpl: message payload (JSON/XML)
LImpl-->>Ctrl: MqMessage {body, contentType, headers}
Ctrl-->>App: response body string

